Decided to do this one on alt.org just for fun.  I usually just run
nethack in cygwin on my laptop.  It was fun to get an interesting
bones level and see all the funky names of the ghosts and such.  It is
kind of funny to ascend and still be 1855 on the top 2000 list!

 I did a number of dumb things like zapping myself with a wand of
cancellation (by accident) and fighting with a master mind flayer when
I didn't have to.  It was challenging because I didn't get reflection
or magic resistance until I found a wand of wishing in a chest in a
quest level graveyard.  After that it was easy.  I finished the game
with 5 wishes left on the castle wand.

